What is logged?
```javascript
const p1 = Promise.resolve(1);
const p2 = Promise.reject(2);
Promise.all([p1, p2])
  .then(r => console.log('success', r))
  .catch(e => console.log('error', e));
```

What is the output?
```javascript
async function test() {
  try {
    const result = await Promise.reject('error');
    console.log(result);
  } catch (e) {
    console.log('caught', e);
  }
}
test();
```

